{"id":"00030","root":"uni00030_1","name":{"ja":"ミラベル・ベル","en":"Mirabell Bell"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ミラベル・ベル","en":"Mirabell Bell"},"element":"Science","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":30,"profile":{"ja":"米連陸軍特殊機械化部隊所属の分隊長。褐色の美しき女軍曹。ＸＰＳ－１１Ａボーンのパイロット。米連陸軍による中華連合系施設への強襲作戦で数々の武勲をあげる優秀な下士官。堅実な戦術指揮能力と強化外骨格による近接射撃戦のエキスパート。今や旧式となりつつあるボーンも彼女が乗れば見違えるようなスペックを発揮する。中東で続く米連の対テロ戦争において軍事顧問団の“手足”として活躍していたが廃棄都市アミダハラにおける勢力争いが激化すると、魔界の医療技術に関連する米連の権益を守る実力部隊として来日する事に。新設された女性兵士だけの強化外骨格ユニット『ストームキャット』の初代隊長に就任する。","en":"Mirabell Bell serves as a squad leader in the U.S. Army's Special Mechanized Unit. A dark-skinned, strikingly beautiful female sergeant, she pilots the XPS-11A Bone. As an outstanding non-commissioned officer, she has earned numerous commendations during the U.S. assault on a Sino-Allied facility, demonstrating solid tactical command and expertise in close-quarters shooting with her reinforced exoskeleton. Though the Bone is becoming outdated, it performs like a new model when she's at the controls. After serving as a \"hand\" of the military advisory team in the ongoing U.S. counter-terrorism war in the Middle East, she was dispatched to Japan to protect U.S. interests tied to Demon Realm medical technology amid the escalating power struggle in the ruined city of Amidahara. She now commands the newly formed all-female exoskeleton unit \"Stormcat\" as its inaugural captain."},"illustrator":"おぶい","voiceActor":"向井れん","forms":[{"id":"uni00030_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[940,1881],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[140,281],"def":[123,246],"spd":[38,38],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["5","79"]},{"id":"uni00030_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1380,2760],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[215,432],"def":[181,363],"spd":[38,38],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["5","79","80"]},{"id":"uni00030_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"sta