,3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"「『ストームキャット』隊長、ミラベル・ベル。これより指揮下に加わる」","en":"I'm Mirabell Bell, captain of Stormcat. From now on, I'm under your command."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00030_1/uni00030_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"待機も任務の内だ。即時行動の準備は出来ているぞ、指示を出せ","en":"I consider standby part of the mission. I'm ready for immediate action, give the orders."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00030_1/uni00030_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"作戦行動の為ならいざ知らず、現状その様な言動をする必要がどこにある？","en":"Unless it's for an operation, I see no need for that kind of talk right now."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00030_1/uni00030_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"私をなんだと思ってるんだ？　休憩くらい取るに決まっているだろ……む、時間か、休憩終了だ","en":"What do you think I am? Of course I'm taking a break... Huh, time's up, break's over."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00030_1/uni00030_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"強化外骨格の内部環境は整えられているとは言え、過酷な環境下での戦闘時は熱くて大変なんだ","en":"Even though the exoskeleton's interior is regulated, fighting in harsh conditions gets hot and tough."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00030_1/uni00030_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"生身の私が戦えないと思っているのか？　緊急時の生存率を上げるため鍛錬は欠かしていない","en":"You think I can't fight without the suit? I never skip training to boost my survival in emergencies."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00030_1/uni00030_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"陸軍特殊機械化部隊、ストームキャットを女性だけの新設部隊と甘く見るなよ？","en":"Don't underestimate the Army's Special Mechanized Unit, Stormcat, just because it's an all-female squad."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00030_1/uni00030_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"この私とチームを組む以上、風紀を乱す様な行いはゆるさん。自覚をもって行動しろ","en":"If you're 